+| Native, `cargo test --all-targets` | 102 PASS | 102 PASS |
+| Документационные `compile_fail` | 3 PASS | 3 PASS |
+| Rust FFI crate, `cargo test --all-targets` | 31 PASS | 31 PASS |
+| Сборка DLL | PASS | PASS |
