+records the source and artifact hashes, 12 controlled foreign-result runs,
+five optional-group compatibility runs, the expected freshness-control failure,
+the closed-snapshot RED/GREEN regression and separate PE export checks.
+Those controls and binary inspections are not added to the ordinary suite totals.
+
+The source assertions are in [Rust boundary tests](src/members_tests.rs),
+the [native historical getter tests](../src/windows.rs), and
+[Go member lifecycle tests](go/members_windows_test.go). Separate
