+ * Borrowed root has only BORROWED_ORIGINAL, never close fields. Before close an
+ * owned resource has flags=0. Afterwards CLOSE_ATTEMPTED requires exactly one
+ * of CLOSED/CLOSE_FAILED. CLOSE_FAILED indicates NativeFailure presence
+ * independently of close_error (zero is allowed); absent failure requires zero.
